# Brewfile
#
# Managed by zdot. Run `brew bundle` to install.
# Run `brew bundle cleanup` to remove packages not listed here.
#
# Supply chain policy:
#   - No third-party taps (use official install methods for those tools)
#   - Runtimes (Go, Node, Python, Ruby) via mise or direct install, not brew
#   - Prefer the main homebrew tap; review any new addition before adding
#
# Go: install from https://go.dev/dl/ or via mise (mise install go)
# Node, Python, Ruby: managed via mise (https://mise.jdx.dev)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core CLI
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
